{"Title":"An Act relative to soldiers' home eligibility for certain national guard members","BillNumber":"H3496","DocketNumber":"HD3696","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PAD1","Name":"Patricia A. Duffy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:14:17.21"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PAD1","Name":"Patricia A. Duffy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:14:17.21"},{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-08T09:54:37.8466667"},{"Id":"N_C0","Name":"Nick Collins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/N_C0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-25T11:20:52.8666667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3496/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Duffy of Holyoke, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3496) of Patricia A. Duffy and Steven S. Howitt relative to soldiers' home eligibility for certain national guard members.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1 of Chapter 115A of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words “section two,” the following words:-\r\n\t“or (c) any person who meets the requirements of the Massachusetts National Guard state retired list, as defined in section 31 of chapter 33, notwithstanding any general law or special law to the contrary”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}